 1212 E55A  03          POWTB:	DB 3		; drive A: [0..39] / 2^3 -> 0..4 (800K)
 1213 E55B  03          	DB 3		; drive B: [0..39] / 2^3 -> 0..4 (800K)
 1214 E55C  03          	DB 3		; drive C: [0..39] / 2^3 -> 0..4  1.44MB 1024 Byte
